Assume that the code compiles and runs correctly, and that the system calls run
successfully without any errors.<pre><code>
int x = 3;
while(x > 0) {
fork();
printf("hello");
wait(NULL);
x--;
}</pre></code>
The total number of times the printf statement is executed is ___
